review:
I don't know how our ancestors felt when they found that beyond the mountain the world keeps extending;
how Гагарин felt as the first human to enter space;
how Armstrong felt stepping on the Moon;
how Astronomers felt observing light indeed bent as Einstein hypothesized;
how Physicists felt realizing electrons passing the double slit are responding to observation.

After Outer Wilds, I at least can imagine the feelings.
